+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Orders currently support no discounts. Customers expect to redeem the coupons the
+system already stores, so orders must be able to apply a coupon and settle on a
+reduced final amount.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` accepting `{ "couponCode": "<CODE>" }`.
+- Apply a `FIXED` coupon as a flat cents discount and a `PERCENT` coupon as a
+  percentage of the order amount, honoring the coupon's optional
+  `maxDiscountCents` cap.
+- Validate the coupon before applying it: it must exist, be `ACTIVE`, be inside
+  its validity window, satisfy `minAmountCents`, and still have remaining uses.
+- Validate the order before applying it: it must exist and be `PENDING`, and it
+  must not already carry a coupon.
+- Cap the discount at the order amount so the final amount never goes negative.
+- Record the redemption and increment the coupon's `usedCount` in the same
+  transaction that updates the order.
+- Return the updated order (same shape as `GET /orders/:id`), including
+  `discountCents`, `finalAmountCents`, and `couponCode`.
+- Errors use the existing `AppError` envelope with UPPER_SNAKE codes
+  (`ORDER_NOT_FOUND`, `ORDER_NOT_PENDING`, `COUPON_NOT_FOUND`, `COUPON_DISABLED`,
+  `COUPON_EXPIRED`, `COUPON_NOT_YET_VALID`, `COUPON_ALREADY_APPLIED`,
+  `COUPON_MIN_AMOUNT_NOT_MET`, `COUPON_USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED`, `INVALID_REQUEST`).
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+- `order-coupons`: applying an existing coupon to a pending order, including
+  discount computation, eligibility validation, redemption bookkeeping, and the
+  resulting order totals.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/routes/orders.ts`: registers the new route.
+- `src/services/orderService.ts`: coupon application rules; depends on the
+  injected `Clock` for validity-window checks.
+- `src/repositories/orderRepository.ts`: persists the order's discount, final
+  amount, and coupon code.
+- `src/repositories/couponRepository.ts`: redemption insert and `usedCount`
+  increment.
+- `src/app.ts`: wires the coupon repository into `OrderService`.
+- Existing schema in `src/db.ts` already provides the needed columns and the
+  `coupon_redemptions` table; no migration is required.
